2026-09-10T05:34:48.4435360Z [36;1m# PERRY_LLVM_OPT and PERRY_LLVM_CLANG must come from the same bin dir or[0m
2026-09-10T05:34:48.4435846Z [36;1m# opt and clang can skew across majors — so it has to sit under $PREFIX.[0m
2026-09-10T05:34:48.4436306Z [36;1mif [ ! -x "$PREFIX/bin/clang" ] && [ -x /usr/bin/clang-22 ]; then[0m
